# Workflow rules remain binding

"Merge everything", "just merge", urgency, and green CI do not waive:

- deterministic required CI;
- `bot-feedback-gate` and conversation resolution;
- explicit disposition of substantive review threads;
- `pr:arm-and-park` and its default-base guard.

Only an explicit written waiver for that PR changes feedback closeout.
